  "body": "Imagine waking each morning to the sight of the ocean stretching out before you and ending the day watching the sun dip behind the horizon as the waves gently roll onto beautiful Orewa Beach. Positioned just one property back from the shoreline, this exceptional residence offers an enviable coastal lifestyle where luxury, comfort, and breathtaking scenery come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nHaving been almost entirely rebuilt to an impressive standard, this stunning home has been thoughtfully designed to embrace its spectacular beach and ocean outlook while providing effortless everyday living. From the moment you enter, there is an immediate sense of warmth and sophistication, with quality finishes, generous living spaces, and an abundance of natural light creating a home that feels both inviting and refined.\r\n\r\nBuilt with durable aluminium cladding and solid concrete block construction, the home combines modern elegance with peace of mind. Rich French Oak flooring adds warmth and character throughout, while plantation shutters and remote-controlled sunscreen and blackout blinds provide both style and practicality.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed designer kitchen that will delight those who love to cook and entertain. Complete with stone benchtops, premium appliances, and exceptional attention to detail, it effortlessly connects with the spacious dining and living areas, creating a welcoming hub for family gatherings and entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nThe generous floor plan offers two separate living areas, allowing everyone their own space to relax and unwind. Whether you're enjoying cosy evenings indoors or hosting family and friends, this home adapts beautifully to every occasion.\r\n\r\nA true highlight is the luxurious master suite, a private sanctuary designed for rest and relaxation. Featuring a walk-in wardrobe and an elegant ensuite complete with a bath, twin vanities, and a separate shower, it feels more like a boutique hotel retreat than a bedroom. Two further bedrooms are generously proportioned and are serviced by a beautifully finished family bathroom.\r\n\r\nSeamlessly extending from the interior are multiple large decks that provide the perfect places to entertain, dine alfresco, or simply sit back and take in the ever-changing sea views. Whether enjoying your morning coffee, hosting summer barbecues, or watching boats pass across the horizon, these outdoor spaces create an incredible connection to the sea.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort, a separate laundry, extensive storage solutions, and a double garage, ensuring practicality matches the home's undeniable style.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal is the superb location. Leave the car at home and enjoy an easy stroll to Orewa's vibrant cafés, popular restaurants, local markets, and village shops. With the beach only moments away, every day feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nThis is far more than just a home; it is a lifestyle opportunity in one of Orewa's most sought-after coastal positions. Properties of this calibre are rarely offered to the market. If you have been dreaming of luxury beachside living with breathtaking views and an exceptional level of comfort, this remarkable residence deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the warmth, elegance, and beauty of this stunning coastal home for yourself. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
